  "Name": "RD_MOVETORTV",
  "Description": "Retail Distribution -Return to Vendor\n\nRetail Distribution - Return to Vendor is simply a NONStock Location RTV.  We do a REPLENISH Process to Split the TrackingEntity from the Bin in the Warehouse to the Vendor Location(RTV).  TrackingEntity is always Location_ItemCode. Qty is always 1.  Alias is always resolved to ItemCode\n\nIn the Prescript Prescript_MoveToRTV_ToTrackingEntity, If the Source trackingEntity does not exist, We do a CLR_Takeon to create it.  The reason is to allow a Return to Vendor Directly from a Store, where we may never have processed the Item before, so dont have the FromTrackingEntity.",
